bluejetty:00077966:ios.description:
Welcome to this classic addictive puzzle game. Relax while this wood block puzzle game gently trains your brain. Enjoy this block puzzle game by solving wooden block puzzles.
Just match the woody blocks and solve the wooden block puzzles! It is a relaxing cube block puzzle game. Solving wood block puzzles is great for stress relieving while challenging yourself.
Block puzzle game gameplay;
- Place the wood blocks onto the board
- Stack cube blocks vertically & horizontally to smash them;
- Once you can't place any more blocks, the round is over!;
- Match as many blocks as you can to get a higher score!
Highlights:
1. Detailed, handcrafted block puzzle games;
2. Easy to play; one hand is all you need;
3. Minimal design for this IQ test brain game;
4. No time limit; take your time with the block puzzles;
5. Wi-Fi free; you can still enjoy this game offline;
6. Small file size; available for most devices;
This wood block puzzle game is just the type of relaxing game to challenge your IQ and your luck without giving you a headache. Play this wooden block puzzle game with your friends in your leisure time and get close to each other! Give it a shot and enjoy this wonderful brain game. 
Privacy policy: https://cdn.api-alliance.com/tpm/apps/iospuzzlepool/privacy.html

